# X0X_AMY (build/host/x0x_amy_host): the cost of every AMY voice at once. Six keys held (all of
# synth 1's voices, X0X_AMY_VOICES) for 3 s, recorded to amy_load.wav; the run ends with the instructions
# per sample while AMY sounds, to compare with x0x_host on a playing pattern.
#   build/host/x0x_amy_host host/amy_load.x0x OUTDIR
wait 300
wav amy_load.wav
key w0 down
key w2 down
key w4 down
key w7 down
key w9 down
key w11 down
wait 3000
key w0 up
key w2 up
key w4 up
key w7 up
key w9 up
key w11 up
wait 2000
wavstop
